			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "EXPLANATION OF PURCHASE BENEFITS"
			description: [
				"&2Welcome Power User. You've been granted access to the DLC shop!"
				""
				"&2We at the FOP believe that to obtain the highest sense of Pride and Accomplishment, as well as protect users new to the Game Server, that everything beyond basic components and systems are not available to new users. Instead, users must earn access!"
				""
				"&2As you can see, the Store DLC is organized into catagories, to help aid you in perusal of our fine DLC offerings!"
				""
				"&2At first, you'll have only a few items available to purchase. As a reward for unlocking the DLC Shop, please accept this Iron Pickaxe! May you harvest much with it!"
			]
			dependencies: ["1B6761988ABBBC4A"]
			hide: true
			id: "6D986E5817BEF5A1"
