				}
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: -0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Fight For Fun!"
			description: [
				"&2Vault Coins are easy to earn! There are multiple approved methods of earning Vault Coins in the FOPGame Server."
				""
				"&2The primary way all users can earn Vault Coins is inside the Vaults! You can find piles of Coins scattered around some points of interest! They'll be guarded though, so be ready to fight!"
				""
				"&2The second approved method of earning Vault Coins is by completing Bounties! Make yourself a Bounty Table, and you can select a Bounty that can earn you Vault Coins, amongst other rewards!"
				""
				"&2The final approved method, and easiest, is to procure resources and materials, and DIGITALIZE them!"
				""
				"&4&lALL OTHER METHODS ARE UNAUTHORIZED. AVOID FOR YOUR SAFETY!"
			]
			dependencies: ["05F4CBBD146B0DBB"]
			hide: true
			id: "22810A844797AC73"
