			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Combat Improved"
			description: [
				"&2Unlike our previous server offerings for combat, the primary combat in the FOP Game Server is handled by Better Combat. Smoother animations, combos, and more, which have a much different feel to vanilla Minecraft combat!"
				""
				"&2The combat animations and combos change depending on what weapons you are using. A sword, for exmaple, will feeld ifferent than a Battlestaff or an Axe!"
				""
				"&2If you are very used to Vanilla combat, our combat system may feel jarring and out of place. Our apologies, but we would highly recommend giving it a chance through a couple Vaults first!"
				""
				"&2If you still prefer Vanilla Minecraft combat, you can enable and disable Better Combat by pressing the appropriate keybind. By default, this is Period."
			]
